h/Enterprise (more integrations)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do you verify our WhatsApp number for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We handle every Meta interaction on your behalf: (1) Facebook Business Manager verification (business documents + legal entity proof), (2) WABA creation + phone-number claim, (3) display-name approval (Meta reviews for compliance), (4) template message pre-approval (marketing + utility + service categories), (5) two-factor auth setup + admin roles. Typical verification timeline 5-10 business days. You maintain full ownership of the WhatsApp account."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What are Meta's per-conversation charges for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Meta bills you directly per 'conversation window' (24-hour session, category-dependent, India rates 2026): <strong>Marketing conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.78/conv (promotional broadcasts), <strong>Utility conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.11/conv (order updates, alerts), <strong>Authentication conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.11/conv (OTP delivery), <strong>Service conversations</strong> FREE (customer-initiated, 24hr window — Nov 2024 update). GCC rates 3-5x higher in USD/SAR/AED. We pass Meta charges through at zero markup."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can we integrate WhatsApp chatbot with our CRM for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes at Business tier and above. Supported CRMs: Zoho CRM (native), HubSpot (native), Salesforce (native), LeadSquared (native), Freshdesk + Zendesk (support), custom REST API + webhook (for in-house CRMs). Two-way sync: leads captured in chat auto-created as CRM contact + conversation logs + lifecycle updates + workflow triggers. Setup 3-7 business days depending on CRM."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can WhatsApp chatbot accept payments for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes at Growth tier and above. Payment gateways supported: Razorpay, Cashfree, PayU (India), Stripe (international), native UPI (India). Payment flow: (1) bot generates payment link mid-conversation, (2) user clicks + pays via UPI/card/wallet, (3) bot receives webhook confirmation, (4) bot sends confirmation + digital receipt. Supported for one-time payments, EMI, subscriptions, refunds."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you build AI-powered WhatsApp chatbots for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes at Growth + Enterprise tiers. AI options: (1) GPT-4/GPT-4o powered responder with your knowledge base fine-tuning, (2) Claude Sonnet/Opus for complex reasoning + longer context, (3) Google Gemini for multimodal (image + text), (4) intent detection + NLU for smart routing between rule-based flows + AI. AI conversations cost Rs 3-15 per exchange (LLM API pass-through, no markup). Bilingual + multilingual AI supported."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we prevent spam + get approved by Meta for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Meta approval + non-suspension requires: (1) legitimate business + verifiable documents, (2) opt-in-only broadcast lists (never scraped/purchased numbers), (3) template messages that follow Meta content policy (no promotional-in-utility templates), (4) response rate above Meta's threshold, (5) low block-rate + report-rate from recipients. We build every account with these guardrails from day 1 + monitor quality rating monthly."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can we get the green-tick verified badge for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — we handle the application at Enterprise tier + as an add-on (Rs 25,000 one-time) at other tiers. Green tick criteria (as of 2026): notable brand with Wikipedia presence + significant press coverage + high organic search volume. Meta approves 20-40% of applications on first submission. No guarantee — we prep the strongest case + resubmit if rejected."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How is WhatsApp chatbot better than app or website for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Numbers speak: <strong>WhatsApp open rate 70-90%</strong> (vs email 15-25%), <strong>response rate 45-60%</strong> (vs email 3-8%), <strong>zero app install</strong> (2.5B users already have WhatsApp), <strong>bookmarkable conversation history</strong>, <strong>no login/password</strong> (phone-verified once), <strong>24/7 automated + human handoff seamless</strong>. Best for: repeat interactions, high-frequency touches, customer support, transactional confirmations, bookings, payment collection."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we get started with WhatsApp chatbot for Gym + Fitness Studios businesses in Kuwait City?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Two ways: (1) Fill the package form on this page — we respond within 24 hours with scoped proposal + call slot. (2) <a href=\"https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a free 30-min Calendly consultation</a> directly. We audit your use case (trial booking + membership plans + payment + class booking + attendance tracking + retention nurture + referrals), scope the bot, share fixed-price proposal within 48 hours. First bots go live within 4-6 weeks of contract."}}]}</script>
